# NOTE: artifacts/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The trained model files (scaler.pkl, feature_columns.pkl, churn_model.keras)
# are small (~82KB total) and must be committed so Render can serve predictions
# without re-running the full training pipeline on every deploy.
